WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:13.746
I am ten years old.

2
00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:18.286
My cousin is twenty years old.

3
00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:26.297
My mother is thirty years old.

4
00:00:26.298 --> 00:00:33.007
My father is forty years old.

5
00:00:33.008 --> 00:00:38.738
My aunt is fifty years old.

6
00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:43.210
My uncle is sixty years old.

7
00:00:43.211 --> 00:00:50.020
My grandmother is seventy years old.

8
00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:55.372
My grandfather is eighty years old.

9
00:00:55.373 --> 00:01:00.203
My great-grandmother is ninety years old.

10
00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:10.350
My parrot is one hundred years old!

11
00:01:10.351 --> 00:01:18.394
It is the oldest! "Hello!"
